Cell["\<\
Dropping the far vertex breaks inextensibility, so the truncation is no \
longer a ray.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"fded0a00-1946-4d2b-a9f6-6e923598bd9f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
